         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A detailed black and white vector illustration of a mountain bike in side view. The bicycle features a sturdy triangular frame, front suspension fork, and large spoked wheels. The rear wheel is equipped with a derailleur gear system, while the chain and pedals are clearly visible. The handlebars are slightly raised with ergonomic grips, and the saddle is positioned for an optimal riding posture. This high-quality vector drawing is ideal for bike-related designs, educational materials, or technical illustrations.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">bike</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <xmp:CreatorTool>Adobe Illustrator 30.8 (Windows)</xmp:CreatorTool>
